{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/932809-camazotz-and-thousand-wing-form","id":932809,"title":"Camazotz and Thousand Wing Form","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Werewolf: The Apocalypse"],"posts":[{"date":"2016-07-16T23:25:23-07:00","id":932809,"title":"Camazotz and Thousand Wing Form","content":"So something popped in my head concerning the &quot;Thousand Wing Form&quot; for Camazotz. It says that it works just like Anasazi and their crawling form, so I assume that means you select leaders and all that jazz. Here is the thing, if a lot of spiders die, for the Anasazi they eat a lot of other spiders to rebuild themselves. So if a lot of bats are killed, do people think the surviving leaders would have to eat bats to rebuild? How would this work out? It just feels like an odd thing for bats to do.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1179-celtspz","name":"CeltSPZ","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1179_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"835"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-16T23:44:19-07:00","id":932816,"title":"","content":"They need to eat things, not just other spiders.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3953-dwight","name":"Dwight","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3953_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2355"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-17T07:58:40-07:00","id":932905,"title":"","content":"On another note, I had a game where a bunch of Bastet hunted down Camazotz Kinfolk and helped them resurrect their lost Breed by finding them a new spiritual patron.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11683-aya-tari","name":"Aya Tari","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11683_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5986"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-18T09:50:33-07:00","id":933457,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Aya Tari</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/932809-camazotz-and-thousand-wing-form?p=932905#post932905\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">On another note, I had a game where a bunch of Bastet hunted down Camazotz Kinfolk and helped them resurrect their lost Breed by finding them a new spiritual patron.</div> </div> </div> </div>What patron did you go with?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://drive.google.com/uc?export=view&amp;id=0B9RzepSqCby3Mi1KUmJ5aWUwRVk\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/805-idpersona","name":"idpersona","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar805_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2117"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-18T10:33:27-07:00","id":933478,"title":"","content":"Strangely enough, it ended up being Turtle. In exchange for taking the Camazotz, the characters also had to find Croatan Kinfolk and help them resurrect the tribe. We ended up with one hundred Camazotz Kinfolk and one hundred Croatan Kinfolk living with around one hundred Qualmi Kinfolk and one hundred Pumonca Kinfolk. I think we ended up with a dozen Camazotz and around four children that had a good chance of becoming the first Croatan in over four hundred years. The interbreeding was quite interesting, as I ruled that Kinfolk that mated with Kinfolk of other breeds had twice the normal fertility because of Gaia blessing the efforts to unify her children.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11683-aya-tari","name":"Aya Tari","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11683_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5986"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-20T02:24:48-07:00","id":934360,"title":"","content":"The Camatotz would just need to eat tons and tons of fruit and insects. Eventually they'd have enough mass to shift back into the other forms.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:arial\">What doesn't kill you, makes you...<i> stranger</i>.</span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1182-asmodai","name":"Asmodai","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1182_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2989"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}